 "applies_to": "Thermokon NOVOS 7, NOVOS Touch and thanos EVO touch-screen room operating units with RS485 BACnet MS/TP.",
 "summary": "NOVOS 7, NOVOS Touch and thanos EVO are touch-screen room operating units that share one BACnet MS/TP object list. They expose room climate (occupancy, ECO, setpoint, fan stage), up to eight lighting circuits, eight shading channels, eight scenes, display icons and up to four built-in sensors. Configuration is done with Thermokon's uConfig tool and sent to the unit as a file over BACnet.",
